  interlocutorName: ???????
  onStart:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  lines:
  - npcText: Wow, you made it here, quite impressive... Unfortunately, this place
      is not playable yet, but you can still go back to the hospital. Thank you for
      stepping into the Infernet, I'm sure you understand the potential of the Pentacle
      Protocol. Who knows, maybe we'll see eachother again...
    answers:
    - text: Wait no...
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Finally !
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Can I contact the dev team ?
      nextLineIndex: 1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - npcText: Yes you can, They have a page on Itch.io called Pentacle Protocol, you
      will find their contact there.
    answers:
    - text: Thank you.
      nextLineIndex: -1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
